    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      We may update these terms. If a change materially affects a paying customer, we will email you before it takes effect.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Questions about these terms — <code class="font-mono text-fg">support@tracelane.dev</code>.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle">Last updated: July 28, 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
